{"3418990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Shattered Divinities","steam_appid":3418990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Divine War has ruined the world. Mutated creatures roam the land and through frozen time, while the remaining lives struggle to survive on the edge of oblivion and despair. The secrets of the deities before their fall lie buried beneath the broken temple, the stagnant current of time, and endless ruins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Divinities is a 2D pixel-style Metroidvania action-adventure game. You play as a warrior awakened amid the ruins, braving perils such as the tainted Land, the lightless abyss, and the formidable stairways. Challenge powerful foes that stand in your way, claim the powers left behind by the fallen deities, and uncover the forgotten truth. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/2e36528b877c61b44212d2b3645dea07.avif?t=1792988481\" width=1200 height=301 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine broken lands with different styles and over a hundred intricate maps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid those sacred divine realms now roam 20 powerful bosses corrupted by divine power, as well as creatures of various shapes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bloodstains left by the Guide, the notes of the Researcher, the unfulfilled duty of the Gatekeeper… their meaning will be retrieved with your blade.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/96c02debfd4a055eb06295a8700d7ee5.avif?t=1792988481\" width=776 height=192 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/221bef60448352dfc951ff6f6916ef2f.avif?t=1792988481\" width=776 height=192 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/e5ae119bd5338f3ab15a99609a2b9d25.avif?t=1792988481\" width=776 height=192 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/ef5877d6a90e685bcfaa917bf8ed00eb.avif?t=1792988481\" width=1200 height=301 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather divine marks and reach your full strength with their might.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks with [Phase Step], nimbly maneuver with [Ethereal Step], counter foes with impenetrable defense via [Bulwark], strike your enemies like a rainstorm with [Assault], and summon creatures to aid you with [Invocation].<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your marks. Use the moves and combinations derived from the five marks to forge the build that suits you best!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And harness mighty divine possession to become unstoppable in battle!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must keep exploring this land to gain more powerful abilities. Once you can wield these abilities flexibly, you may become a new god!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/5fac5e04640e3ec330f8fdc81db4bc11.avif?t=1792988481\" width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/123a26a583e013cb24bd9291a369be76.poster.avif?t=1792988481\" width=776 height=192 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/123a26a583e013cb24bd9291a369be76.webm?t=1792988481\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/123a26a583e013cb24bd9291a369be76.mp4?t=1792988481\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/6950a7329c599b8d9c362550106e01a0.poster.avif?t=1792988481\" width=776 height=192 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/6950a7329c599b8d9c362550106e01a0.webm?t=1792988481\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/6950a7329c599b8d9c362550106e01a0.mp4?t=1792988481\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/6e136abda8cbc435d78beefffe57e889.poster.avif?t=1792988481\" width=776 height=192 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/6e136abda8cbc435d78beefffe57e889.webm?t=1792988481\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/6e136abda8cbc435d78beefffe57e889.mp4?t=1792988481\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3418990\/extras\/0c0b202c01bba332c34fb44aa05207b6.avif?t=1792988481\" width=1200 height=301 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability shards scattered across the land hold immense power capable of turning the tide of any battle.<\/p><p class=\"